{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:61574fe25a335031","name":"Janek Sunber","source":{"id":"source:reference-61574fe25a335031","title":"Janek Sunber","revision":20682,"timestamp":"2024-08-26T00:18:41Z","sha256":"5ff277d357ba35ad5f00c45163a280d5f701370e30f75b29b39bdd58cfb6e528","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=20682","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Janek%20Sunber&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-61574fe25a335031","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Rebellion Era Campaign Guide"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Rebellion_Era_Campaign_Guide"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Affiliations: ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Galactic Empire"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Galactic_Empire","referenceId":"reference:f9c9a48674cc3415"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Perhaps Janek Senber's greatest claim to fame is that he and ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"}," are friends while the two are growing up on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"},". But Skywalker joins the Rebellion, and Sunber becomes a loyal servant of the Empire. On ",{"tag":"a","children":["Tatooine"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Tatooine","referenceId":"reference:a1b911e88e4876e1"},", Sunber is known as \"Tank\" because of his size. Although he flies through Beggar's Canyon many times, his skills do not meet the minimum requirements to enter the Imperial Flight Academy. Instead, the recruiters see Sunber as another strong back and hard head- the perfect candidate for infantry training.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["However, Sunber surprises his instructors with his quick thinking and strategic planning, and he is enrolled in officer training. Within a year, he is serving as a lieutenant under the command of ",{"tag":"a","children":["Captain Gage"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Captain_Gage?action=edit&redlink=1"},". Gage comes from a privileged background, and the two clash spectacularly. During a deployment to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Maridun"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Maridun?action=edit&redlink=1"},", Gage's superior, ",{"tag":"a","children":["General Ziering"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/General_Ziering?action=edit&redlink=1"},", observes Sunber in action and is impressed. When the detachment comes under attack by the native ",{"tag":"a","children":["Amanin"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Amanin"},", Sunber assumes a leadership role and Ziering gives him a field promotion to the rank of commander- placing him over Gage. When the general dies during the battle, Gage later claims that he is unaware of the order- ensuring the Sunber remains a lieutenant.\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["On his next assignment, Sunber captures an underground Rebel fortress on ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jabiim"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jabiim?action=edit&redlink=1"}," and enslaves the survivors. After transporting the slaves, Sunber meets his old friend ",{"tag":"a","children":["Luke Skywalker"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Luke_Skywalker","referenceId":"reference:9d008045040e138b"},", who is dressed as an Imperial officer. Sunber soon discovers that Skywalker is a Rebel. Disillusioned, Sunber tries and fails to apprehend Skywalker. Realizing that he has vital information about The Rebel Alliance's Jedi Knight, Sunber takes that intelligence directly to ",{"tag":"a","children":["Darth Vader"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Darth_Vader","referenceId":"reference:c167be702b56cffc"},".\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Vader sends Sunber on a mission to infiltrate the Alliance, using his childhood connection with Skywalker to earn the Rebels' trust. When Skywalker vouches for Sunber and brings him aboard the Alliance fleet's flagship, Sunber attempts to seize control of the bridge. A shot from the Imperial fleet takes out the flagship's artificial gravity, and Sunber is apparently killed. But before the Rebel flagship escapes to hyperspace, once ",{"tag":"a","children":["Escape Pod"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Escape_Pod","referenceId":"reference:a257ab4a352c2042"}," launches and is recovered by the Imperial fleet.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Janek Sunber Statistics (CL 6)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Medium ",{"tag":"a","children":["Human"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Human","referenceId":"reference:9ffa865f2bc6e850"}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Nonheroic"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Nonheroic","referenceId":"reference:1bca2ef1d9ebe1c3"}," 2/",{"tag":"a","children":["Soldier"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Soldier","referenceId":"reference:f826baa05bef6921"}," 5/",{"tag":"a","children":["Officer"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Officer","referenceId":"reference:192135a8adabe174"}," 1\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Force Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Force_Points"},":"]}," 5; ",{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Dark Side Score"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Dark_Side_Score"},":"]}," 2\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +9; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +5\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":["Languages:"]}," Basic, Huttese\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Refl